I removed the redundant second field lookup by calling `CanSupportSubField` directly on the `Field` already found. This keeps identical behavior while avoiding an extra search through the message fields.

```cpp
FIT_UINT8 Mesg::GetFieldUINT8Value(const FIT_UINT8 fieldNum, const FIT_UINT8 fieldArrayIndex, const FIT_UINT16 subFieldIndex) const
{
    const Field *field = GetField(fieldNum);

    if ((field == FIT_NULL) || (!field->CanSupportSubField(subFieldIndex)))
        return FIT_UINT8_INVALID;

    return field->GetUINT8Value(fieldArrayIndex);
}
```